# Knowledge Base Directory

This directory contains tax law documents and resources used for RAG.

Due to copyright and size constraints, tax documents are not included in the repository.

## Required Documents (Canada)

- CRA Folio S5-F1-C1 (Residency Determination)
- Form NR73 Guide
- Tax Treaties (Canada-UAE, Canada-USA, etc.)

## Directory Structure

```
knowledge_base/
├── canada/
│   ├── cra_folio_s5_f1_c1.pdf
│   ├── form_nr73_guide.pdf
│   └── treaties/
├── usa/
├── uae/
└── uk/
```

## How to Populate

Download tax documents from official sources:
- Canada: https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency.html
- USA: https://www.irs.gov/
- UAE: https://tax.gov.ae/
- UK: https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/hm-revenue-customs
